WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come into Hero Pose, sitting between the heels on a block if needed.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Place a bolster or stacked blankets behind you.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Walk the hands back and lower onto the support, one vertebra at a time.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest the arms alongside or overhead if the shoulders are happy.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, press into the elbows, come up, and stretch the legs forward.
